
# Secrets — never committed (mirrors .claude/settings.json permissions.deny)
# EVERY .env* is secret and there is no exception: the non-secret example file
# is `env.example` (no leading dot), which is not matched here and so is
# committed normally. Do not re-add a `!.env.example` negation — it is what
# made .gitignore, shell_guard.py and write_guard.py disagree (handoff B3).
.env
.env.*
*.pem
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Session handoff — local working state, not project history. Written by
# /save-context, read by /resume-context, overwritten whole each time. There is no
# archive directory: archiving was removed as ceremony (~/.claude/DECISIONS.md,
# 2026-08-25), so nothing produces one to ignore.
session-context.md
